OL,3,GNEWSAHospital under significant
OL,4,Apressure as patient waits increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FManx Care's latest annual report has
OL,7,Frevealed pressure on the Isle of Man's
OL,8,Fhealth service, including an average
OL,9,F56-week wait for a first consultant
OL,10,Fappointment and a #14.9m overspend.
OL,12,FThe report, which covers the period
OL,13,Ffrom 1 April 2025 to 31 March 2026,
OL,14,Ffound Noble's Hospital was operating
OL,15,Funder significant pressure for almost
OL,16,Fhalf the year, while emergency
OL,17,Fdepartment waiting times also
OL,18,Fincreased.
OL,20,FIt outlines the challenges facing the
OL,21,Fisland's health and care services, as
OL,22,Fwell as areas where progress was made.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
