OL,3,GNEWSAHospital under significant
OL,4,Apressure as patient waits increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeresa Cope, who was chief executive
OL,7,Fduring the period, said: "It was a year
OL,8,Fof continued service delivery and
OL,9,Freform, but also of significant
OL,10,Ffinancial, operational and workforce
OL,11,Fpressure."
